{"ticker":"IT","updated":"2026-10-23T23:09:21Z","profile":{"longName":"Gartner, Inc.","shortName":"Gartner, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gartner.com","fullTimeEmployees":19285,"marketCap":14541945856,"trailingPE":20.820976,"forwardPE":14.053752,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.2498124,"pegRatio":0.93,"targetMeanPrice":193.76923,"targetHighPrice":235.0,"targetLowPrice":150.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.006,"earningsGrowth":0.331,"grossMargins":0.69629997,"operatingMargins":0.22623,"profitMargins":0.11996,"totalRevenue":6463626240,"beta":0.978,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":257.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":124.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Gartner, Inc. provides business and technology insights to support decision-making and performance on an organization's mission-critical priorities in the United States, Canada, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Insights, Conferences, and Consulting. The Insights segment delivers insights through subscription services, such as access to published content, data and benchmarks, and direct access to a network of business and technology experts. The Conferences segment enables executives and teams to learn, share, and network through its Symposium/Xpo series and peer-driven sessions, as well as through its conferences focused on specific business roles and topics. The Consulting segment provides technology-driven strategic initiatives, including custom analysis and on-the-ground support to senior executives. This segment also offers actionable solutions for IT-related priorities, including IT cost optimization, digital transformation, and IT sourcing optimization. The company was formerly known as Gartner Group, Inc. and changed its name to Gartner, Inc. in November 2001. Gartner, Inc. was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut.","summary_zh":"Gartner, Inc. 提供業務和技術見解，以支援美國、加拿大、歐洲、中東、非洲和國際組織關鍵任務優先事項的決策和績效。它透過三個部門運作：洞察部門、會議部門和諮詢部門。洞察部門透過訂閱服務提供洞察，例如存取已發布的內容、數據和基準，以及直接存取業務和技術專家網路。會議部分使管理人員和團隊能夠透過其研討會/Xpo 系列和同行驅動的會議，以及透過專注於特定業務角色和主題的會議來學習、分享和建立聯繫。諮詢部門提供技術驅動的策略舉措，包括客製化分析和為高階主管提供現場支援。該部門也為 IT 相關優先事項提供可行的解決方案，包括 IT 成本優化、數位轉型和 IT 採購優化。該公司前身為 Gartner Group, Inc.，並於 2001 年 11 月更名為 Gartner, Inc.。 Gartner, Inc. 成立於 1979 年，總部位於康乃狄克州斯坦福。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":249.5,"h":249.5,"l":241.2,"c":241.47,"v":1209800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":241.05,"h":244.23,"l":241.05,"c":243.13,"v":2532900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":242.62,"h":246.38,"l":242.47,"c":246.36,"v":1037800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":247.24,"h":248.56,"l":245.15,"c":247.73,"v":881800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":247.68,"h":251.36,"l":247.06,"c":251.19,"v":920100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":248.26,"h":251.07,"l":247.2,"c":250.91,"v":1057600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":249.5,"h":250.19,"l":245.06,"c":247.58,"v":986100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":246.8,"h":246.8,"l":236.29,"c":236.73,"v":1251100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":237.88,"h":246.07,"l":237.47,"c":245.91,"v":1304600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":245.76,"h":247.48,"l":239.76,"c":246.26,"v":1420500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":244.21,"h":246.6,"l":241.58,"c":246.28,"v":1024800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":244.93,"h":245.42,"l":231.33,"c":232.59,"v":1259800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":233.84,"h":242.0,"l":233.0,"c":241.12,"v":1381500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":244.66,"h":247.84,"l":242.91,"c":247.33,"v":2214200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":251.5,"h":253.3,"l":246.59,"c":246.89,"v":2560400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":246.24,"h":251.87,"l":244.99,"c":250.88,"v":2021100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":251.73,"h":256.6,"l":251.15,"c":253.92,"v":1430900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":256.5,"h":257.49,"l":251.3,"c":253.02,"v":2190600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":253.87,"h":257.33,"l":252.5,"c":256.39,"v":4285600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":253.96,"h":262.31,"l":253.96,"c":260.13,"v":1762900},{"t":"2025-09-23"